---

<PageLayout title='Academic' {headings} info={{ slug: '/academic', hideComment: true }}>
  <h2 id='about-me'>About Me<a class='anchor' href='#about-me'>#</a></h2>
  <p>
    我是湖南科技大学数据科学与大数据技术专业本科生，并进入东南大学硕士阶段（研0）。目前在湖南省服务计算与软件服务新技术重点实验室开展研究，导师为康国胜教授。
  </p>
  <p>
    我的研究关注图数据挖掘、图神经网络、大语言模型、智能体与事件序列预测，探索结构化数据与语义建模之间的连接。
  </p>
  <Button title='GitHub profile' class='w-fit' href='https://github.com/Jinhui524' target='_blank'>
    <Icon class='size-5' name='github' slot='before' />
  </Button>

  <h2 id='research-interests'>Research Interests<a class='anchor' href='#research-interests'>#</a></h2>
  <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3'>
    {[
      ['图数据挖掘', 'Graph data mining', 'ros'],
      ['图神经网络', 'Graph neural networks', 'pytorch'],
      ['大语言模型', 'Large language models', 'chatgpt'],
      ['智能体 Agent', 'AI agents', 'openai'],
      ['事件序列预测', 'Event sequence prediction', 'timeline'],
      ['结构化语义建模', 'Structured semantic modeling', 'document']
    ].map(([title, description, icon]) => (
      <div class='group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4 transition-all hover:border-foreground/25 hover:shadow-md'>
        <div class='flex items-start gap-4'>
          <div class='flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/20'>
            <SimpleIcon class='size-5 text-primary transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110' name={icon} />
          </div>
          <div class='flex-1'>
            <p class='text-xl font-medium leading-tight text-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-primary'>{title}</p>
            <p class='text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground'>{description}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2 id='publications'>Publications<a class='anchor' href='#publications'>#</a></h2>
  <PublicationSection {publications} />

  <h2 id='awards'>Awards<a class='anchor' href='#awards'>#</a></h2>
  <ul>
    <li>第七届传智杯全国 IT 技能大赛编程挑战赛二等奖。</li>
    <li>2025 RAICOM 机器人开发者大赛编程技能赛道三等奖。</li>
    <li>2026 RAICOM 机器人开发者大赛智海算法优化赛道一等奖。</li>
    <li>第二十八届中国机器人及人工智能大赛湖南赛区一等奖。</li>
    <li>第二十一届湖南省大学生程序设计竞赛一等奖。</li>
    <li>第十六届蓝桥杯软件和信息技术人才大赛二等奖。</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
